{"book":"Phm","name":"Philemon","chapters":{"1":{"1":{"text":"Paul, a prisoner of Jesus Christ, and Timothy our brother, unto Philemon our dearly beloved, and fellowlabourer,","words":[{"t":"Paul,"},{"t":"a"},{"t":"prisoner"},{"t":"of"},{"t":"Jesus"},{"t":"Christ,"},{"t":"and"},{"t":"Timothy"},{"t":"our"},{"t":"brother,"},{"t":"unto"},{"t":"Philemon"},{"t":"our"},{"t":"dearly"},{"t":"beloved,"},{"t":"and"},{"t":"fellowlabourer,"}]},"2":{"text":"And to our beloved Apphia, and Archippus our fellowsoldier, and to the church in thy house:","words":[{"t":"And"},{"t":"to"},{"t":"our"},{"t":"beloved"},{"t":"Apphia,"},{"t":"and"},{"t":"Archippus"},{"t":"our"},{"t":"fellowsoldier,"},{"t":"and"},{"t":"to"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"church"},{"t":"in"},{"t":"thy"},{"t":"house:"}]},"3":{"text":"Grace to you, and peace, from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ.","words":[{"t":"Grace"},{"t":"to"},{"t":"you,"},{"t":"and"},{"t":"peace,"},{"t":"from"},{"t":"God"},{"t":"our"},{"t":"Father"},{"t":"and"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"Lord"},{"t":"Jesus"},{"t":"Christ."}]},"4":{"text":"I thank my God, making mention of thee always in my prayers,","words":[{"t":"I"},{"t":"thank"},{"t":"my"},{"t":"God,"},{"t":"making"},{"t":"mention"},{"t":"of"},{"t":"thee"},{"t":"always"},{"t":"in"},{"t":"my"},{"t":"prayers,"}]},"5":{"text":"Hearing of thy love and faith, which thou hast toward the Lord Jesus, and toward all saints;","words":[{"t":"Hearing"},{"t":"of"},{"t":"thy"},{"t":"love"},{"t":"and"},{"t":"faith,"},{"t":"which"},{"t":"thou"},{"t":"hast"},{"t":"toward"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"Lord"},{"t":"Jesus,"},{"t":"and"},{"t":"toward"},{"t":"all"},{"t":"saints;"}]},"6":{"text":"That the communication of thy faith may become effectual by the acknowledging of every good thing which is in you in Christ Jesus.","words":[{"t":"That"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"communication"},{"t":"of"},{"t":"thy"},{"t":"faith"},{"t":"may"},{"t":"become"},{"t":"effectual"},{"t":"by"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"acknowledging"},{"t":"of"},{"t":"every"},{"t":"good"},{"t":"thing"},{"t":"which"},{"t":"is"},{"t":"in"},{"t":"you"},{"t":"in"},{"t":"Christ"},{"t":"Jesus."}]},"7":{"text":"For we have great joy and consolation in thy love, because the bowels of the saints are refreshed by thee, brother.","words":[{"t":"For"},{"t":"we"},{"t":"have"},{"t":"great"},{"t":"joy"},{"t":"and"},{"t":"consolation"},{"t":"in"},{"t":"thy"},{"t":"love,"},{"t":"because"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"bowels"},{"t":"of"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"saints"},{"t":"are"},{"t":"refreshed"},{"t":"by"},{"t":"thee,"},{"t":"brother."}]},"8":{"text":"Wherefore, though I might be much bold in Christ to enjoin thee that which is convenient,","words":[{"t":"Wherefore,"},{"t":"though"},{"t":"I"},{"t":"might"},{"t":"be"},{"t":"much"},{"t":"bold"},{"t":"in"},{"t":"Christ"},{"t":"to"},{"t":"enjoin"},{"t":"thee"},{"t":"that"},{"t":"which"},{"t":"is"},{"t":"convenient,"}]},"9":{"text":"Yet for love's sake I rather beseech thee, being such an one as Paul the aged, and now also a prisoner of Jesus Christ.","words":[{"t":"Yet"},{"t":"for"},{"t":"love's"},{"t":"sake"},{"t":"I"},{"t":"rather"},{"t":"beseech"},{"t":"thee,"},{"t":"being"},{"t":"such"},{"t":"an"},{"t":"one"},{"t":"as"},{"t":"Paul"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"aged,"},{"t":"and"},{"t":"now"},{"t":"also"},{"t":"a"},{"t":"prisoner"},{"t":"of"},{"t":"Jesus"},{"t":"Christ."}]},"10":{"text":"I beseech thee for my son Onesimus, whom I have begotten in my bonds:","words":[{"t":"I"},{"t":"beseech"},{"t":"thee"},{"t":"for"},{"t":"my"},{"t":"son"},{"t":"Onesimus,"},{"t":"whom"},{"t":"I"},{"t":"have"},{"t":"begotten"},{"t":"in"},{"t":"my"},{"t":"bonds:"}]},"11":{"text":"Which in time past was to thee unprofitable, but now profitable to thee and to me:","words":[{"t":"Which"},{"t":"in"},{"t":"time"},{"t":"past"},{"t":"was"},{"t":"to"},{"t":"thee"},{"t":"unprofitable,"},{"t":"but"},{"t":"now"},{"t":"profitable"},{"t":"to"},{"t":"thee"},{"t":"and"},{"t":"to"},{"t":"me:"}]},"12":{"text":"Whom I have sent again: thou therefore receive him, that is, mine own bowels:","words":[{"t":"Whom"},{"t":"I"},{"t":"have"},{"t":"sent"},{"t":"again:"},{"t":"thou"},{"t":"therefore"},{"t":"receive"},{"t":"him,"},{"t":"that"},{"t":"is,"},{"t":"mine"},{"t":"own"},{"t":"bowels:"}]},"13":{"text":"Whom I would have retained with me, that in thy stead he might have ministered unto me in the bonds of the gospel:","words":[{"t":"Whom"},{"t":"I"},{"t":"would"},{"t":"have"},{"t":"retained"},{"t":"with"},{"t":"me,"},{"t":"that"},{"t":"in"},{"t":"thy"},{"t":"stead"},{"t":"he"},{"t":"might"},{"t":"have"},{"t":"ministered"},{"t":"unto"},{"t":"me"},{"t":"in"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"bonds"},{"t":"of"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"gospel:"}]},"14":{"text":"But without thy mind would I do nothing; that thy benefit should not be as it were of necessity, but willingly.","words":[{"t":"But"},{"t":"without"},{"t":"thy"},{"t":"mind"},{"t":"would"},{"t":"I"},{"t":"do"},{"t":"nothing;"},{"t":"that"},{"t":"thy"},{"t":"benefit"},{"t":"should"},{"t":"not"},{"t":"be"},{"t":"as"},{"t":"it"},{"t":"were"},{"t":"of"},{"t":"necessity,"},{"t":"but"},{"t":"willingly."}]},"15":{"text":"For perhaps he therefore departed for a season, that thou shouldest receive him for ever;","words":[{"t":"For"},{"t":"perhaps"},{"t":"he"},{"t":"therefore"},{"t":"departed"},{"t":"for"},{"t":"a"},{"t":"season,"},{"t":"that"},{"t":"thou"},{"t":"shouldest"},{"t":"receive"},{"t":"him"},{"t":"for"},{"t":"ever;"}]},"16":{"text":"Not now as a servant, but above a servant, a brother beloved, specially to me, but how much more unto thee, both in the flesh, and in the Lord?","words":[{"t":"Not"},{"t":"now"},{"t":"as"},{"t":"a"},{"t":"servant,"},{"t":"but"},{"t":"above"},{"t":"a"},{"t":"servant,"},{"t":"a"},{"t":"brother"},{"t":"beloved,"},{"t":"specially"},{"t":"to"},{"t":"me,"},{"t":"but"},{"t":"how"},{"t":"much"},{"t":"more"},{"t":"unto"},{"t":"thee,"},{"t":"both"},{"t":"in"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"flesh,"},{"t":"and"},{"t":"in"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"Lord?"}]},"17":{"text":"If thou count me therefore a partner, receive him as myself.","words":[{"t":"If"},{"t":"thou"},{"t":"count"},{"t":"me"},{"t":"therefore"},{"t":"a"},{"t":"partner,"},{"t":"receive"},{"t":"him"},{"t":"as"},{"t":"myself."}]},"18":{"text":"If he hath wronged thee, or oweth thee ought, put that on mine account;","words":[{"t":"If"},{"t":"he"},{"t":"hath"},{"t":"wronged"},{"t":"thee,"},{"t":"or"},{"t":"oweth"},{"t":"thee"},{"t":"ought,"},{"t":"put"},{"t":"that"},{"t":"on"},{"t":"mine"},{"t":"account;"}]},"19":{"text":"I Paul have written it with mine own hand, I will repay it: albeit I do not say to thee how thou owest unto me even thine own self besides.","words":[{"t":"I"},{"t":"Paul"},{"t":"have"},{"t":"written"},{"t":"it"},{"t":"with"},{"t":"mine"},{"t":"own"},{"t":"hand,"},{"t":"I"},{"t":"will"},{"t":"repay"},{"t":"it:"},{"t":"albeit"},{"t":"I"},{"t":"do"},{"t":"not"},{"t":"say"},{"t":"to"},{"t":"thee"},{"t":"how"},{"t":"thou"},{"t":"owest"},{"t":"unto"},{"t":"me"},{"t":"even"},{"t":"thine"},{"t":"own"},{"t":"self"},{"t":"besides."}]},"20":{"text":"Yea, brother, let me have joy of thee in the Lord: refresh my bowels in the Lord.","words":[{"t":"Yea,"},{"t":"brother,"},{"t":"let"},{"t":"me"},{"t":"have"},{"t":"joy"},{"t":"of"},{"t":"thee"},{"t":"in"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"Lord:"},{"t":"refresh"},{"t":"my"},{"t":"bowels"},{"t":"in"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"Lord."}]},"21":{"text":"Having confidence in thy obedience I wrote unto thee, knowing that thou wilt also do more than I say.","words":[{"t":"Having"},{"t":"confidence"},{"t":"in"},{"t":"thy"},{"t":"obedience"},{"t":"I"},{"t":"wrote"},{"t":"unto"},{"t":"thee,"},{"t":"knowing"},{"t":"that"},{"t":"thou"},{"t":"wilt"},{"t":"also"},{"t":"do"},{"t":"more"},{"t":"than"},{"t":"I"},{"t":"say."}]},"22":{"text":"But withal prepare me also a lodging: for I trust that through your prayers I shall be given unto you.","words":[{"t":"But"},{"t":"withal"},{"t":"prepare"},{"t":"me"},{"t":"also"},{"t":"a"},{"t":"lodging:"},{"t":"for"},{"t":"I"},{"t":"trust"},{"t":"that"},{"t":"through"},{"t":"your"},{"t":"prayers"},{"t":"I"},{"t":"shall"},{"t":"be"},{"t":"given"},{"t":"unto"},{"t":"you."}]},"23":{"text":"There salute thee Epaphras, my fellowprisoner in Christ Jesus;","words":[{"t":"There"},{"t":"salute"},{"t":"thee"},{"t":"Epaphras,"},{"t":"my"},{"t":"fellowprisoner"},{"t":"in"},{"t":"Christ"},{"t":"Jesus;"}]},"24":{"text":"Marcus, Aristarchus, Demas, Lucas, my fellowlabourers.","words":[{"t":"Marcus,"},{"t":"Aristarchus,"},{"t":"Demas,"},{"t":"Lucas,"},{"t":"my"},{"t":"fellowlabourers."}]},"25":{"text":"The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with your spirit. Amen.","words":[{"t":"The"},{"t":"grace"},{"t":"of"},{"t":"our"},{"t":"Lord"},{"t":"Jesus"},{"t":"Christ"},{"t":"be"},{"t":"with"},{"t":"your"},{"t":"spirit."},{"t":"Amen."}]}}}}